{"id":"1266854123053318144","date":"2020-05-30","url":"https://x.com/kalinowski007/status/1266854123053318144","text":"4. Fights Prop 8 in California at Equality California 5. Connects queer people to the Obama White House for South by South Lawn 6. Promotes visibility for the group in @voguemagazine, 7. Tireless advocate for LGBTQ peeps in tech (emcees NY summit while 9mo pregnant)!","deleted":true,"live_status":410,"archived_at":"20200530221631","archive":"https://web.archive.org/web/20200530221631/https://twitter.com/kalinowski007/status/1266854123053318144","via":"wayback","read_at":"2026-09-30"}
